msgid "A vast wasteland, with a single great hole gaping open."
msgstr "見渡すかぎりの荒野に、大穴がひとつ、口を開けている。"

msgid "At the bottom of the hole lie ruins of an ancient civilization.\n"
msgstr "穴の底には古代文明の遺跡がある。\n"

msgid "Treasure comes out. Monsters too. Half of those who dive never return.\n"
msgstr "宝が出る。怪物も出る。潜った者の半分は帰ってこない。\n"

msgid "Around the hole a town has formed of divers, sellers, and buyers."
msgstr "穴のまわりには潜る者、売る者、買う者で街ができた。"

msgid "\"Heard about it? Another bottom-seeker vanished.\"\n"
msgstr "「聞いたか。底狙いの奴、また一人消えたってよ。」\n"

msgid "\"How many is that now?\"\n"
msgstr "「何人目だ。」\n"

msgid "\"Who knows. I quit counting long ago.\"\n\n"
msgstr "「さあな。数えるのはとっくにやめた。」\n\n"

